menu "Speed truck supervisor"

config SPEED_GPS_ENABLED
    bool "Enable GPS"
    default y
    help
        10 Hz GPS module on UART1. A 1 Hz module is useless here — at target
        speed it samples once every 31 meters.

config SPEED_SD_LOGGING
    bool "Enable SD card logging"
    default y

config SPEED_WIFI_STREAM
    bool "Enable WiFi telemetry stream"
    default n
    help
        TCP 3737 for commands and telemetry, UDP 3738 for lossy high-rate
        plotting. Off by default: WiFi on a speed run is a distraction and the
        SD log is the record that matters.

endmenu
